  "description": "Spring is in the air, the flowers are blooming…and the freshmen are thirsting. It’s the start of the semester, and everyone’s dreaming of the perfect campus life. But college isn’t all sunshine and cherry blossoms. It’s also packed with scandalous hookups, secret flings, and outrageous rumors that spread faster than midterm anxiety. From the library to the lecture halls, these tantilising tales are being whispered behind every closed dorm door. Want to find out what really goes down on campus?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
